# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!example.tfvars

# Plan artifacts (may embed account detail) — regenerate, don't commit
tfplan
plan.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally committed (HashiCorp best practice)
# so provider versions are pinned and reproducible across machines.

# AWS / kube credentials — never commit
kubeconfig
*.pem
.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
